IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sga1-alteration`

-- Tests for sga1-alteration.l4 (ss 71 to 73B). Every expected value is written from the text of the section, beside the assertion.
-- Arguments are positional, in the order of each function's GIVEN.

§ `Section 71: power of company to alter its share capital`

-- (1) Arguments: the constitution authorises the alteration; the alteration is made in general meeting; the alteration.
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` TRUE TRUE `s 71(1)(b) consolidate and divide all or any of its share capital` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` TRUE TRUE `s 71(1)(c) convert all or any of its paid-up shares into stock and reconvert that stock into paid-up shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (d): the proportion between the amount paid and the amount unpaid must be kept
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` TRUE TRUE (`s 71(1)(d) subdivide its shares or any of them` TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` TRUE TRUE (`s 71(1)(d) subdivide its shares or any of them` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (e): only shares not taken or agreed to be taken, or forfeited
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` TRUE TRUE (`s 71(1)(e) cancel the number of shares which have not been taken or agreed to be taken, or which have been forfeited, and diminish the share capital` TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` TRUE TRUE (`s 71(1)(e) cancel the number of shares which have not been taken or agreed to be taken, or which have been forfeited, and diminish the share capital` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not authorised by the constitution, or not made in general meeting: the gate is unmet, the subsection does not say the company may not
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` FALSE TRUE `s 71(1)(b) consolidate and divide all or any of its share capital` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` TRUE FALSE `s 71(1)(b) consolidate and divide all or any of its share capital` EQUALS NOTHING
-- a way the paragraphs do not list
#ASSERT `s 71(1) the company may alter its share capital in the way` TRUE TRUE `s 71(1) some other alteration` EQUALS NOTHING

-- (1A) Arguments: public company; it has altered its share capital.
#ASSERT `s 71(1A) the public company may lodge with the Registrar a notice of the alteration` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 71(1A) the public company may lodge with the Registrar a notice of the alteration` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 71(1A) the public company may lodge with the Registrar a notice of the alteration` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (1B) Arguments: private company; a notice of alteration in the prescribed form has been lodged.
#ASSERT `s 71(1B) the private company may alter its share capital by lodging the notice` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 71(1B) the private company may alter its share capital by lodging the notice` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 71(1B) the private company may alter its share capital by lodging the notice` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (1C) Arguments: private company; the day of the alteration; the register has been updated under section 196A(5).
#ASSERT `s 71(1C) the alteration has not yet taken effect` TRUE (Date 5 3 2016) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 71(1C) the alteration has not yet taken effect` TRUE (Date 5 3 2016) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 71(1C) the alteration has not yet taken effect` TRUE (Date 3 1 2016) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 71(1C) the alteration has not yet taken effect` TRUE (Date 2 1 2016) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 71(1C) the alteration has not yet taken effect` FALSE (Date 5 3 2016) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (2) Argument: the cancellation of shares is made under section 71.
#ASSERT `s 71(2) the cancellation is deemed to be a reduction of share capital within the meaning of this Act` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 71(2) the cancellation is deemed to be a reduction of share capital within the meaning of this Act` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (3)(a) Arguments: unlimited company having a share capital; a resolution passed for the purposes of section 30(1); no part of the increased capital is capable of being called up except in a winding up.
#ASSERT `s 71(3)(a) the unlimited company may increase the amount of its share capital by increasing the issue price of each of its shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "but subject to the condition": the condition unmet
#ASSERT `s 71(3)(a) the unlimited company may increase the amount of its share capital by increasing the issue price of each of its shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 71(3)(a) the unlimited company may increase the amount of its share capital by increasing the issue price of each of its shares` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 71(3)(a) the unlimited company may increase the amount of its share capital by increasing the issue price of each of its shares` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3)(b) Arguments: unlimited company having a share capital; a resolution passed for the purposes of section 30(1).
#ASSERT `s 71(3)(b) the unlimited company may provide that a specified portion of its uncalled share capital is not capable of being called up except in a winding up` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 71(3)(b) the unlimited company may provide that a specified portion of its uncalled share capital is not capable of being called up except in a winding up` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 71(3)(b) the unlimited company may provide that a specified portion of its uncalled share capital is not capable of being called up except in a winding up` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 72: validation of shares improperly issued`

-- Arguments: purported to issue or allot shares; the issue was invalid or the terms were inconsistent or unauthorised; the application is made by the company, a holder or mortgagee, or a creditor; the Court is satisfied that it is just and equitable.
#ASSERT `s 72 the Court may make an order validating the issue or allotment of the shares or confirming the terms of issue or allotment` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 72 the Court may make an order validating the issue or allotment of the shares or confirming the terms of issue or allotment` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 72 the Court may make an order validating the issue or allotment of the shares or confirming the terms of issue or allotment` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 72 the Court may make an order validating the issue or allotment of the shares or confirming the terms of issue or allotment` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 72 the Court may make an order validating the issue or allotment of the shares or confirming the terms of issue or allotment` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Arguments: the Court has made an order; a copy of the order has been lodged with the Registrar.
#ASSERT `s 72 the shares are deemed to have been validly issued or allotted upon the terms of the issue or allotment` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 72 the shares are deemed to have been validly issued or allotted upon the terms of the issue or allotment` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 72 the shares are deemed to have been validly issued or allotted upon the terms of the issue or allotment` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 73: redenomination of shares`

-- (1) Arguments: the company has a share capital; it has passed an ordinary resolution converting its share capital or a class of shares to another currency; the constitution excludes the exercise of the power.
#ASSERT `s 73(1) the company may convert its share capital or a class of shares from one currency to another currency` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(1) the company may convert its share capital or a class of shares from one currency to another currency` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 73(1) the company may convert its share capital or a class of shares from one currency to another currency` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- subsection (9): the constitution has excluded the power
#ASSERT `s 73(1) the company may convert its share capital or a class of shares from one currency to another currency` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (2) Arguments: the company has a share capital; the resolution is under section 73; authorises more than one occasion; authorises a specified time or specified circumstances.
#ASSERT `s 73(2) the resolution may authorise the company to redenominate its share capital as it does` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(2) the resolution may authorise the company to redenominate its share capital as it does` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(2) the resolution may authorise the company to redenominate its share capital as it does` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 73(2) the resolution may authorise the company to redenominate its share capital as it does` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 73(2) the resolution may authorise the company to redenominate its share capital as it does` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (3) Argument: the redenomination is made at a spot rate of exchange specified in the resolution.
#ASSERT `s 73(3) the redenomination is made as the subsection requires` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(3) the redenomination is made as the subsection requires` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (4) Arguments: a rate prevailing on a day specified in the resolution; the average of rates prevailing on each consecutive day of a period specified in the resolution.
#ASSERT `s 73(4) the rate is one the subsection allows` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(4) the rate is one the subsection allows` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(4) the rate is one the subsection allows` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (5) Arguments: the day specified; the day the resolution is passed. The resolution is passed on 1 March 2026: the 28 days ending on the day before are 1 February to 28 February 2026.
#ASSERT `s 73(5) the day specified is within the period of 28 days ending on the day before the resolution is passed` (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(5) the day specified is within the period of 28 days ending on the day before the resolution is passed` (Date 28 2 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(5) the day specified is within the period of 28 days ending on the day before the resolution is passed` (Date 31 1 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day the resolution is passed is not in the period
#ASSERT `s 73(5) the day specified is within the period of 28 days ending on the day before the resolution is passed` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Arguments: the first day of the period; the last day of the period; the day the resolution is passed.
#ASSERT `s 73(5) the period specified is within the period of 28 days ending on the day before the resolution is passed` (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 28 2 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(5) the period specified is within the period of 28 days ending on the day before the resolution is passed` (Date 31 1 2026) (Date 28 2 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73(5) the period specified is within the period of 28 days ending on the day before the resolution is passed` (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73(5) the period specified is within the period of 28 days ending on the day before the resolution is passed` (Date 20 2 2026) (Date 10 2 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (6) Arguments: the resolution is under section 73; it specifies conditions which must be met before the redenomination takes effect.
#ASSERT `s 73(6) the resolution may specify conditions which must be met before the redenomination takes effect` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(6) the resolution may specify conditions which must be met before the redenomination takes effect` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 73(6) the resolution may specify conditions which must be met before the redenomination takes effect` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (7) Arguments: the day the resolution is passed; the resolution determines a later day; the later day; the conditions are met (or none); the day on which the question is asked.
#ASSERT `s 73(7) the redenomination has taken effect` (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(7) the redenomination has taken effect` (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) TRUE (Date 28 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a later day determined in accordance with the resolution
#ASSERT `s 73(7) the redenomination has taken effect` (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) TRUE (Date 14 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73(7) the redenomination has taken effect` (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a condition of the resolution that is not yet met
#ASSERT `s 73(7) the redenomination has taken effect` (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (8) Arguments: the day the resolution is passed; the redenomination has taken effect; the day it took effect; the day on which the question is asked.
-- passed on 1 March 2026: the 28 days beginning on that date end on 28 March 2026
#ASSERT `s 73(8) the resolution has lapsed` (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 29 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(8) the resolution has lapsed` (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 28 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73(8) the resolution has lapsed` (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 20 3 2026) (Date 29 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- it took effect on 28 March, the last day of the period: not lapsed; on 29 March it had not taken effect at the end of the period
#ASSERT `s 73(8) the resolution has lapsed` (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 28 3 2026) (Date 30 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73(8) the resolution has lapsed` (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 29 3 2026) (Date 30 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- (9) Argument: the constitution excludes or restricts the exercise of a power conferred by section 73.
#ASSERT `s 73(9) the constitution may exclude or restrict the exercise of a power conferred by section 73` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(9) the constitution may exclude or restrict the exercise of a power conferred by section 73` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (10) Arguments: the conversion is of share capital or of a class of shares; it is from one currency to another.
#ASSERT `s 73(10) "redenomination" the conversion is a redenomination` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73(10) "redenomination" the conversion is a redenomination` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73(10) "redenomination" the conversion is a redenomination` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 73A: effect of redenomination`

#ASSERT `s 73A(1) the redenomination of shares affects the matter` `s 73A(1)(a) the rights or obligations of members under the company's constitution, or the restrictions affecting members under it` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73A(1) the redenomination of shares affects the matter` `s 73A(1)(b) the entitlement to dividends (including the entitlement to dividends in a particular currency)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73A(1) the redenomination of shares affects the matter` `s 73A(1)(b) voting rights` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73A(1) the redenomination of shares affects the matter` `s 73A(1)(b) the liability in respect of amounts remaining unpaid on shares (including liability in a particular currency)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- any other matter: the paragraphs do not say
#ASSERT `s 73A(1) the redenomination of shares affects the matter` `s 73A(1) some other matter` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2) Arguments: the thing is the constitution; the thing is a term on which shares are allotted or held.
#ASSERT `s 73A(2) the thing is within the company's constitution for the purposes of subsection (1)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73A(2) the thing is within the company's constitution for the purposes of subsection (1)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73A(2) the thing is within the company's constitution for the purposes of subsection (1)` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 73B: notice of redenomination`

-- (1) Arguments: passed a resolution under section 73; the day it was passed; the notice has been delivered; the day it was delivered; the day on which the question is asked.
-- passed on 1 March 2026: the 14th day is 15 March 2026
#ASSERT `s 73B(1) the company is late in delivering the notice of redenomination to the Registrar` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(1) the company is late in delivering the notice of redenomination to the Registrar` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 16 3 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73B(1) the company is late in delivering the notice of redenomination to the Registrar` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 16 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73B(1) the company is late in delivering the notice of redenomination to the Registrar` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no resolution under section 73: the duty does not arise
#ASSERT `s 73B(1) the company is late in delivering the notice of redenomination to the Registrar` FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 73B(1) a company must deliver the notice of redenomination to the Registrar within 14 days after passing the resolution` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 73B(1) deliver to the Registrar a notice in the specified form of the redenomination` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 73B(1) a company must deliver the notice of redenomination to the Registrar within 14 days after passing the resolution` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 73B(1) deliver to the Registrar a notice in the specified form of the redenomination` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 73B(1) a company must deliver the notice of redenomination to the Registrar within 14 days after passing the resolution` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

-- (2) Arguments: (a) total number of issued shares; (b) amount paid up and unpaid on all shares; (c) total issued share capital; (d)(i) the particulars in subsection (3); (d)(ii) total number in the class; (d)(iii) paid up and unpaid in the class; (d)(iv) total issued capital of the class.
#ASSERT `s 73B(2) the notice includes the information the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73B(2) the notice includes the information the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(2) the notice includes the information the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(2) the notice includes the information the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(2) the notice includes the information the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(2) the notice includes the information the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(2) the notice includes the information the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(2) the notice includes the information the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (3) Arguments: (a) voting rights; (b) dividends; (c) capital, including on a winding up; (d) whether the shares are redeemable.
#ASSERT `s 73B(3) the notice states the particulars the subsection specifies for the class` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73B(3) the notice states the particulars the subsection specifies for the class` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(3) the notice states the particulars the subsection specifies for the class` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(3) the notice states the particulars the subsection specifies for the class` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(3) the notice states the particulars the subsection specifies for the class` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (4) Arguments: default is made in complying with the section; the person is an officer of the company who is in default.
#ASSERT `s 73B(4) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 73B(4) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 73B(4) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a fine not exceeding $4,000 and a default penalty of $250; no imprisonment
#ASSERT `s 73B(4) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 73B(4) penalty` OF 4000, 0, FALSE, TRUE, 250)
#ASSERT `s 73B(4) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
